1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,340
Three thousand years ago,
an Egyptian court sentenced

2
00:00:03,340 --> 00:00:06,880
more than thirty people for
a plot against their pharaoh.

3
00:00:07,280 --> 00:00:12,440
The record of their trial survives — and
it never says what happened to the king.

4
00:00:12,960 --> 00:00:18,000
The answer stayed hidden for three
thousand years, on the king himself.

5
00:00:18,520 --> 00:00:20,900
His name was Ramesses the Third,

6
00:00:20,920 --> 00:00:25,280
and the danger that reached him
came from inside his own house.

7
00:00:25,880 --> 00:00:28,860
A pharaoh's harem was not
a pleasure garden but a

8
00:00:28,860 --> 00:00:32,020
household of its own,
with officials and guards.

9
00:00:32,560 --> 00:00:37,860
One of the king's wives, Tiye, had a
son, whom the record calls Pentawer.

10
00:00:38,040 --> 00:00:41,020
But the throne had been
promised to another son.

11
00:00:41,520 --> 00:00:43,580
Tiye set out to change that.

12
00:00:43,800 --> 00:00:47,800
She found allies close to the
king: the chief of his chamber,

13
00:00:48,060 --> 00:00:52,200
royal butlers, harem officials,
a commander of the army.

14
00:00:52,980 --> 00:00:56,480
Messages went out to their
families: "Stir up the people!

15
00:00:56,520 --> 00:00:59,580
Incite enemies to hostility
against their lord."

16
00:01:00,060 --> 00:01:05,200
They had magic, too: wax figures, made
with a magic roll that belonged to

17
00:01:05,200 --> 00:01:10,300
Ramesses the Third himself, and smuggled
into the harem to bewitch the guards.

18
00:01:10,720 --> 00:01:13,880
The king's own magic, turned against him.

19
00:01:14,340 --> 00:01:17,500
What happened in the palace,
the record never says.

20
00:01:17,660 --> 00:01:21,060
We know only the end: the king dead,

21
00:01:21,180 --> 00:01:25,100
his chosen son on the throne,
the plotters on trial.

22
00:01:25,400 --> 00:01:28,560
And the record opens in
the king's own voice.

23
00:01:28,840 --> 00:01:32,860
Let all they have done fall
upon their own heads, he says,

24
00:01:32,920 --> 00:01:36,660
"while I am among the just
kings who are before Amun-Ra,

25
00:01:36,740 --> 00:01:40,820
king of gods, and before
Osiris, ruler of eternity."

26
00:01:41,440 --> 00:01:44,720
He speaks like a man
already among the dead.

27
00:01:44,940 --> 00:01:47,700
The accused lost even their names.

28
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:54,400
One butler went into the record as "Ra
hates him", another as "Wicked in Thebes".

29
00:01:54,700 --> 00:01:58,120
To an Egyptian, a name
was part of the soul.

30
00:01:58,640 --> 00:02:01,260
Twenty-two were condemned
in the first trial.

31
00:02:01,660 --> 00:02:04,840
Six more were left to take
their own lives in the court.

32
00:02:05,220 --> 00:02:09,840
Then came the prince: "Pentawer,
who bore that other name."

33
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:12,580
Even Pentawer was not his real name.

34
00:02:12,860 --> 00:02:14,160
"They found him guilty.

35
00:02:14,400 --> 00:02:16,120
They left him in his place.

36
00:02:16,360 --> 00:02:18,060
He took his own life."

37
00:02:18,700 --> 00:02:21,120
Then the court itself went on trial.

38
00:02:21,460 --> 00:02:25,460
Some of the accused women had visited
two of the judges at home and,

39
00:02:25,460 --> 00:02:29,280
the papyrus says, "made
a beer-hall" with them.

40
00:02:29,500 --> 00:02:32,240
Both judges lost their noses and ears.

41
00:02:32,500 --> 00:02:34,940
One of them then took his own life.

42
00:02:35,150 --> 00:02:38,160
Of Tiye's own trial, nothing survives.

43
00:02:38,340 --> 00:02:40,020
Her fate is unknown.

44
00:02:40,660 --> 00:02:42,120
For more than a century,

45
00:02:42,120 --> 00:02:45,780
historians argued over whether
the king had been murdered at all.

46
00:02:46,060 --> 00:02:52,140
His mummy, found in 1881 in a hidden
tomb of royal mummies, showed no wound.

47
00:02:52,220 --> 00:02:54,920
Only a thick collar of
linen around the neck.

48
00:02:55,260 --> 00:02:59,040
In 2012, researchers put
him through a CT scanner.

49
00:02:59,180 --> 00:03:04,040
Under the linen, his throat had
been cut, nearly three inches wide,

50
00:03:04,160 --> 00:03:07,540
through the windpipe and down
to the bones of the spine.

51
00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:11,360
Inside the wound sat
an Eye of Horus amulet,

52
00:03:11,560 --> 00:03:15,980
most likely placed there by the
embalmers, to heal him for the next life.

53
00:03:16,240 --> 00:03:18,220
So the plot had worked.

54
00:03:18,260 --> 00:03:19,960
The king was dead.

55
00:03:20,360 --> 00:03:22,120
And it had failed.

56
00:03:22,340 --> 00:03:25,400
The son it was meant to crown never ruled.

57
00:03:25,660 --> 00:03:29,400
In the same hidden tomb lay
another body: a young man,

58
00:03:29,400 --> 00:03:33,220
eighteen to twenty, in
a coffin with no name.

59
00:03:33,560 --> 00:03:37,060
He was wrapped in a goatskin,
unclean to Egyptians,

60
00:03:37,220 --> 00:03:40,220
his mouth hanging open
as if he were screaming.

61
00:03:40,620 --> 00:03:44,020
He was catalogued as Unknown Man E.

62
00:03:44,360 --> 00:03:49,240
DNA showed he shared the king's
male line, most likely as a son.

63
00:03:49,600 --> 00:03:53,320
The researchers named him a
possible candidate for Pentawer.

64
00:03:53,720 --> 00:03:58,000
In 2021, Egypt moved its
royal mummies to a new museum,

65
00:03:58,000 --> 00:04:00,800
in a golden parade through Cairo.

66
00:04:01,280 --> 00:04:03,420
Ramesses the Third rode in it.

67
00:04:03,500 --> 00:04:06,120
Right behind him came Ramesses the Fourth,

68
00:04:06,340 --> 00:04:09,180
the son the plotters
had tried to push aside.

69
00:04:09,560 --> 00:04:12,700
The young man in the
goatskin was not among them.

70
00:04:12,780 --> 00:04:14,780
He still has no name.

71
00:04:14,940 --> 00:04:18,340
Only a label: Unknown Man E.

72
00:04:18,720 --> 00:04:22,320
A court tried to erase a
prince by taking his name,

73
00:04:22,420 --> 00:04:26,160
and three thousand years
later, it is still missing.

74
00:04:26,620 --> 00:04:31,760
For more forgotten crimes like this, leave
a like and subscribe to Animated Tales.

75
00:04:32,020 --> 00:04:33,006
Until next time.
